      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Checked again with build 996. Mirrors are not fixed in my Udon world. \nBut i noticed interesting: In Desktop mode, the mirrors have correct high resolution. In VR, they switched to auto mode, means it will show lower resolution.\nI go check some Udon worlds for the mirror, and will come back if they have same problem or not.\nIn Unity, i checked the mirrors are set on x1024. Should correct mode, but it doesn't happen in VR mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
