  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-09-20T14:36:19.238Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I was adjusting mirrors in Unity with last SDK, and upload it to server.\nPlayers are asking me why mirror is not sharp. I checked myself again where i am sure it was at high x1024 setting.  That is weird. Something is not right.\nWhen i go back to another Udon world where i know mirrors are sharp before 992 patch is released, i saw they're now also not more sharp. Exact same as new Udon world. Wow, that is not good.\n\nSo, i will post here as new mirror bug for 992 version. It seems they are now as \"auto\" mode and not more at x1024 set (which you can choose in Unity). The auto mode adjust mirror resolution at different distances. Because it doesn't work very well, i set it on high x1024 mode.\n\nNot great bug, because players cannot see themselves sharp in Udon mirrors! Go fix it asap!",
